{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201070/extras/\ub179\ud654_2024_10_01_18_45_45_405.gif?t=1745241141\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u300eGigantes Ex Machina\u300f</strong> is a rogue-lite mecha action shooting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beloved gameplay mechanics such as a randomized power-up leveling system will welcome both new and experienced players into this exciting world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be immersed in thrilling audio fidelity to the myriad gunfire, explosions and pulsating sound effects as you race across the\u00a0battlefield!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201070/extras/\ub179\ud654_2024_10_01_18_44_29_217.gif?t=1745241141\" />Smartly use IRCM to evade the constant barrage of bullets\u00a0and\u00a0missiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">War! Intrigue! Nations and Mega Corporations vie for control over an ancient weapon discovered in the near future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must pilot the mecha <strong>\u201cGigas\u201d\u00a0</strong>and survive against endless waves of enemies in order to achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201070/extras/\ub179\ud654_2024_10_01_16_54_40_458.gif?t=1745241141\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In an era of constant war between nations and mega corporations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the midst of an intensifying arms race, an ancient weapon was unearthed... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Known as Gaia, awakening from its slumber spelled disaster for humanity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Past grievances set aside, new alliances were formed against a common enemy- <strong>Gaia</strong>- in order to save humanity from extinction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You pilot Gigas- an experimental mecha and mankind\u2019s last hope\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a final desperate counter-attack is mounted against Gaia\u2019s onslaught.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3201070?t=1745241141","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201070/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745241141","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201070/a1d62c6546b057d91a46b9065734d828017ad85a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745241141","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201070/a1d62c6546b057d91a46b9065734d828017ad85a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745241141","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3207090,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201070/extras/\ub179\ud654_2024_10_01_18_45_45_405.gif?t=1745241141\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u300eGigantes Ex Machina\u300f</strong> is a rogue-lite mecha action shooting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beloved gameplay mechanics such as a randomized power-up leveling system will welcome both new and experienced players into this